+Two notes on reproduction: Foundry caches invariant counterexamples, so if you see
+`Replayed invariant failure from …`, run `rm -rf cache/invariant/failures` to make the
+invariant search itself run again (it re-finds the drift on a fresh campaign).
+Fuzz and invariant counterexamples differ run to run — the *failure* reproduces every
+time, the specific arguments will not match the transcript above.
